<h2 id="toc0"><span>The Spellcaster</span></h2>
<p>A NPC who becomes a Spellcaster walks the paths of magic. The NPC might be a hedge wizard, a priest, a soothsayer, a magical performer, or a person with magic in their veins.</p>
<p>To gain the Spellcaster class, a creature must have at least one language in its stat block that it can speak.</p>
<p>A NPC gains the following class features as it gains levels, as summarized on the Spellcaster table.</p>
